      "updated_at": "2019-10-10T16:14:49Z",
      "body": "@philip-lamb I talked to the Telemetry team before implementing this and they recommended using an event ping vs the opt-out ping as we can group pings by user: \r\n\r\n> @manuel.martin so what I’m saying is if you send an event, or tack it on the settings of the event ping we can group by user, if we use the opt-out ping we cannot",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
